Just for reference, here's a section of my code that retrieves data from the server, and it works in v0.8: 
```javascript
getKeywords:async({user})=>{
        return fetch("http://haystack-api:8000/keywords",       
        {
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
                "Cookie": new URLSearchParams({"user":user}).toString(),
            }
        }).then(async res => res.json())
}
```
Thank you in advance! '

