b'Sorry for the late reply @DCRepublic 
The format you have seems OK, it is lacking offset information (`answer_start` below) at which character the answer starts (to disambiguate multiple occurrences).

Here is a sample json format for training - it is the official SQuAD format. Note that "context" seems to be your page "text"
```json
{
    "data": [
        {
